## macOS
.DS_Store

## Xcode per-user state
# Window positions, breakpoints, scheme ordering — personal to one machine and
# a constant source of noise in diffs. Shared schemes live in xcshareddata/,
# which IS tracked so `xcodebuild -scheme climyte` works from a clean clone.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

